00:17:23,260 --> 00:17:24,090
Zoro!

260
00:17:24,173 --> 00:17:25,003
Sniper King!

261
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:28,280
Hey, Jumper!

262
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:29,830
Huh?

263
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,140
What's going on?

264
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,555
They're waving at me.

265
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:34,060
Maybe it's a game.

266
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:37,010
Yay!

267
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,560
We're stuck together,

268
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:46,637
stupor, and if you can't find key
number two, they're going to murder us!

269
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,000
Oh, okay.

270
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:56,680
What the hell is this?

271
00:17:57,420 --> 00:18:00,714
I kind of figured there'd be
a bridge here or something.

272
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,737
Man, those whirlpools are really huge.

273
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:07,232
I can see the Gates of Justice from here,

274
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:09,777
but I don't know if I
can get there on a boat?

275
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:13,497
I don't have time to stand here and
think, I gotta give it a shot at least!

276
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:15,157
Here goes nothing.

277
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:17,420
I'm on my way, Robin!

278
00:18:21,940 --> 00:18:26,058
I get it, so the keys and the handcuffs
have matching numbers on them.

279
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:29,997
If you can't fight, then that's
okay, I didn't find anyone,

280
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,817
so I can just beat these guys for you!

281
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:34,317
Sorry, but there's no way
in hell that's gonna happen,

282
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,117
and besides, if you get taken out?

283
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:38,717
We'll be stuck in these
handcuffs with no way to fight.

284
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:39,630
Please.

285
00:18:39,713 --> 00:18:40,654
We're counting on you.

286
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:42,820
You're our only hope Only hope?

287
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:47,380
Flattery doesn't work on me at
all you big dummies Between Sanji,

288
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:50,597
Nami and Franky someone has
to have the number two key.

289
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:52,160
Get it and bring it here.

290
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:53,380
Hurry, okay?

291
00:18:55,660 --> 00:18:58,540
If anyone has a key
already, it's probably Sanji

292
00:18:59,900 --> 00:19:01,760
I've got to find him.

293
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:03,916
I'm their only hope.

294
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,210
No!

295
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:14,340
Yo!

296
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:21,360
I've caught you now, girl!

297
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:24,100
Let go!

298
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:27,980
Yo-yo!

299
00:19:28,540 --> 00:19:33,660
You are far too weak!

300
00:19:36,540 --> 00:19:37,980
Now perish!

301
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:48,740
I'm no match for him at all!

302
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:53,370
Franky!

303
00:19:56,220 --> 00:19:57,900
Iron body! Foxy!

304
00:20:07,780 --> 00:20:10,340
Why are your punches so strong?

305
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:12,680
Wait, you're not human, are you?

306
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:16,537
It's cute how you CP9 guys can
make your bodies hard like iron.

307
00:20:16,620 --> 00:20:19,973
But these fists of mine are
the genuine article, brother!

308
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:24,580
What am I doing?

309
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,580
This is no time for me to be drinking tea!

310
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,710
Witchcraft!

311
00:20:30,793 --> 00:20:32,200
You put me under a spell!

312
00:20:32,460 --> 00:20:34,960
One more sip and I'd be finished! Damn it!

313
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:37,453
I almost got captured in your love trap!

314
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,800
So you say, after three cups.

315
00:20:41,780 --> 00:20:43,000
Shut up, you witch!

316
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:45,217
Don't you dare play innocent with me!

317
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:47,957
I haven't forgotten what
happened on the C-train.

318
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:50,922
I won't forgive the way
you people treated Robin.

319
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,220
Now, give me your key.

320
00:21:01,580 --> 00:21:02,660
What a shame.

321
00:21:03,080 --> 00:21:04,740
It seems you're in a hurry.

322
00:21:05,540 --> 00:21:07,220
Well, I won't keep you.

323
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:09,440
If you want the key, then take it.

324
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,420
So where is it?

325
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,037
Who knows?

326
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:19,140
You'll have to search my body
and find out for yourself.

327
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:21,860
Think you're up to it?

328
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:26,180
You said I am!

329
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,620
You're off to a bad start.

330
00:21:33,140 --> 00:21:35,100
Damn, that was stupid.
